    "overview": "Tayf (Arabic and Turkish for spectrum) is a working application for comparing Earth field-test conditions with Moon and Mars targets. A tinted frame holds the sidebar and top bar; the work sits on a white sheet. Colour goes on data, the chrome stays grey, and the five-stop match spectrum is the brand mark.",
